        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/77aa72/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-12T22:24:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like it overall. I think I'd also replace Thokk with Atomic Glare. But it'd have the same basic effect, just using her Laser Vision die instead of her Strength die.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So, it'd be: \"Atomic Glare: Attack using Laser Vision. Use your max die.\"</p>\n<p>It's mechanically identical to regular Legacy's Thokk, using a d10 and using your max die for the attack, but it gives Young Legacy an ability that takes advantage of her Laser Vision.</p>",
